2. Nature of this bundle
------------------------
This bundle contains connector metadata only: it describes how an MCP
client discovers and connects to a remote MCP service. It contains no
server implementation, no executable backend code, no credentials and
no user data.

The URL https://spmcp.heimanhome.com/mcp in mcp.json and
connector-meta.json is the deployed service endpoint. A deployer running
their own server must replace it with the address of their HTTPS server.


