platform over HTTP. Upstream API definitions, documentation and server
source code are not assets of this project and are not distributed here.

clientId / clientSecret / user accounts / access tokens must be obtained
lawfully from the upstream platform by the deployer. The deployer is
responsible for complying with the upstream terms of service, developer
agreement, quota limits and data-use restrictions, and for confirming
that the integration itself is authorized.


